                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game isn't awful, but it's boring as sh*t. Allow me to explain.\nFirst of all. Steam says it's controller supported, but I had to carefully remap everything in-game. Not a huge deal, but haven't happened to me before, not like this.\nFor the available achievements one could say it's worth to play long-term, when you're felling bored (like REALLY bored), but taking a glimpse at them I can see I'd had to play this for dozens of hours to max everything out. It's insane for such a boring experience.\nYou have a couple of useful moves but realistically you'll only use your special, because it deals so much more DMG, you'll finish your enemies (and the main story) quicker. The regular moves are not even that cool to look at. It is SUPER repetitive.\nI haven't finished the main story, game crashed about 2 times after the fake ending, not worth the effort.\nI appreciate the arena mode, I've tried it once, I see appeal. It's not enough tho.\nIt's a free game, try it. Okay memes. That's about it.",
